I also contributed to performance and capacity assessment across the Event Manager, Processor, reconciliation scheduler, and Product service. This included compiling information on resource utilization, throughput, batch timing, retries, and processing capacity. I identified Kafka resiliency testing as a dependency for surge-capacity and partition-sizing decisions, with completion targeted for November 15.

